  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Edition of 30. Hand sewn. Wood block &amp; letterpress printing. Double leaf format.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"The illustrations in this book by Moshtari were inspired by images, from Lukas's archive of large format negatives taken at photo studios in Peshawar in the 1960s and 70s and transformed into woodblocks. The stories accompanying the images are fictional narratives Lukas created over the course of one month during his afternoon coffee routine. The book was hand-printed and bound in May 2016" -- Page 5.</subfield>
  </datafield>
